Then action() becomes the thin orchestration. Also extract the early-exit paths (no result / still missing) into small functions or keep inline — keep inline, they're short.

One subtlety: in action the original computes `failedResults` and `issueType` before the bug branch — move into handleBug... but it returns null when not applicable:

